Hello There, 
&lt;p&gt;I want to show you guys and get your feedback for my Hacker News client built using React Native.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This maybe a yet another Hacker News client, but there was an inspiration behind building HackerBuzz, and it was &lt;a href=&quot;<a href="https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;simonhalvdansson&#x2F;Harmonic-HN&quot;&gt;Harmonic-HN" rel="nofollow">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;simonhalvdansson&#x2F;Harmonic-HN&quot;&gt;Harmonic-HN</a> by Simon Halvdansson&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;, I saw this app and instantly fell in love with its workings and functionality, and wanted to build something like this by myself, hence started working on HackerBuzz&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Both code and app might not be perfect and could have problems(that I would love feedback on), but I&#x27;m feeling good to show my work to you.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here is the repo: &lt;a href=&quot;<a href="https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;ajshrmaofficial&#x2F;HackerBuzz&quot;&gt;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;ajshrmaofficial&#x2F;HackerBuzz&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;" rel="nofollow">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;ajshrmaofficial&#x2F;HackerBuzz&quot;&gt;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;githu...</a>, and apk is also available at release section.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Start the repo if you like it, feel free to give suggestions.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thank you all ;)&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
